==English==
[[File:Rio Grande do Sul in Brazil.svg|thumb|Rio Grande do Sul, Brazil]]

===Etymology===
From {{bor|en|pt|Rio Grande do Sul}}, which literally means "Great River of the South". ''Rio Grande'' ("Great River") is an old name for the {{w|Lagoa dos Patos}}, and the southern attribution contrasts with [[Rio Grande do Norte]].

